  "replies_posted": [
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/DraftExpress/status/2044167813644812663",
      "reply_text": "Big Ten All-Freshman team is a big deal. Impressive numbers too.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-15T01:10:52.644427+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/RCsWrld/status/2044202437880201263",
      "reply_text": "Yeah, they went from rock bottom to 60 wins in just 2 years. That's a huge turnaround.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-15T01:11:37.638294+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/Utdwavee/status/2044179189524201723",
      "reply_text": "Nick Wright's opinions are always entertaining, but let's keep it real about the top guards",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-15T01:12:25.458970+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/TimGarrisonMN/status/2044183203791908967",
      "reply_text": "That's a huge advantage for Edwards, Reid, and McDaniels. Their playoff experience will be a game-changer soon.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-15T01:13:18.618812+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/RunItBackFDTV/status/2044186587320463639",
      "reply_text": "That's fair. The Wolves have been through a lot, but it's not like the Spurs are a cupcake matchup either.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-15T01:13:53.346641+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/SleeperTWolves/status/2044181786544984512",
      "reply_text": "Big relief for the T'Wolves. That knee was a concern down the stretch",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-15T01:14:29.701544+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/NBA/status/2044209023193403687",
      "reply_text": "Yeah they're playing with energy. Prime is a game-changer",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-15T01:27:07.724693+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/netflixsports/status/2044170154544902496",
      "reply_text": "Agreed. Changed the way defenders approach the perimeter.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-15T01:27:48.315372+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/AndrewDBailey/status/2044174740877938910",
      "reply_text": "Yeah, SGA's case is thin. He's still putting up MVP numbers, though.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-15T01:28:27.233083+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/Underdog/status/2044172692165915020",
      "reply_text": "Doncic's free throw rate is crazy high this season.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-15T01:29:08.036024+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/SwipaCam/status/2044182068641333393",
      "reply_text": "J Mac's defense will be tested, that's for sure.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-15T01:30:02.575594+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/SteveReedAP/status/2044203418214949033",
      "reply_text": "Crowd is electric tonight. Charlotte's D has been solid so far.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-15T01:30:58.663166+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/Hero_OfThe_Day/status/2044178489155125404",
      "reply_text": "Love the trash talk, but let's see how it plays out in a full series.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-15T01:31:49.039099+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/DanBenner1984/status/2044204736719536569",
      "reply_text": "Yeah but the Sixers didn't win a title, just a bunch of lottery picks",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-15T01:32:27.724819+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/BovadaOfficial/status/2044183255683829959",
      "reply_text": "Not sure about 'run it back'. Betting lines are more interesting than his chances.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-15T01:33:15.005848+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/Finding1_1Tingz/status/2044177885292806171",
      "reply_text": "Kareem Abdul-Jabbar's 1975-76 season and Bill Russell's 1961-62 season come close, but none have achieved this exact combination.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-15T01:34:01.008441+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/SleeperCleCavs/status/2044179754614436220",
      "reply_text": "KD's still got it",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-15T01:34:39.710594+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/NoahF31511/status/2044177376956035418",
      "reply_text": "Not sold on the Celtics frontcourt either. They've struggled with size all year",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-15T01:35:19.495136+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/companeromarcus/status/2044173809020793312",
      "reply_text": "That's a fair point. They need to find a way to make it work.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-15T01:36:12.233054+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/WarriorNationCP/status/2044176021642219542",
      "reply_text": "That's some great individual matchups coming up.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-15T01:36:51.724750+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/Unknownn2k/status/2044211600014377450",
      "reply_text": "GCs are usually a grind. Good luck to both sides.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-15T01:47:54.572393+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/billoram/status/2044206809435779581",
      "reply_text": "Unbelievable career numbers. Those guys were clutch for the Blazers",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-15T01:48:32.605378+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/ARBERXHEKAJS/status/2044216739219554594",
      "reply_text": "That assist was clutch. Glad it made your night",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-15T02:00:15.653729+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/Spideys_locked/status/2044209403503464642",
      "reply_text": "Not sure about that MVP talk. Defense isn't fried, they just got outplayed.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-15T02:01:01.703439+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/AZSports/status/2044211297118806184",
      "reply_text": "Booker's back, Suns' offense might be too",
